@startuml 08-briefing
!include ../_style/class.iuml
title Briefing — the stories ranked, chosen and checked for a profile (the cards: 08b-briefing-cards)

class EndUser
package "Presentation" {
    class briefingRouter {
        + GET /briefing
        + POST /briefing
        + POST /briefing/:id/vote
        + POST /briefing/:id/news
        + DELETE /briefing/:id/news/:storyId
        + GET /briefing/:id/stories/:storyId/pictures
    }
    class briefingController {
        + latest()
        + start()
        + vote()
        + importNews()
        + removeNews()
        + pictures()
    }
}
note left of briefingRouter
    The briefing of the profile the page
    chose (x-profile). A news added by its
    link and the pictures are for the
    administrators only, 30 news an hour
end note
package "Guards" as Guards {
    class jwt {
        + authenticateToken()
    }
    class activeProfile {
        + activeProfile()
    }
    class admin {
        + adminOnly()
        + isAdmin()
    }
    class rateLimit {
        + rateLimit()
    }
}
package "Business" {
    class briefingService {
        + latest()
        + start()
        + write()
        + vote()
        + importNews()
        + removeNews()
        + pictures()
    }
    class feedbackService {
        + of()
    }
    class discoveryService <<other feature>> {
        + prune()
    }
    class ingestService <<other feature>> {
        + searchesOfUser()
    }
    class entityService <<other feature>> {
        + briefingGroups()
        + followTerms()
    }
    class briefingMail <<other feature>> {
        + briefingMail()
    }
}
note left of briefingService
    1 to 7 days of news (hours, 48 by default),
    10, 20 or 30 cards (size), written in background,
    one at a time per profile. Its steps saved in
    briefings.step: ranking, choosing, checking,
    reading, summarizing, angles; then the analysis,
    not awaited. The cards are read and written
    with the utils of 08b-briefing-cards
end note
note bottom of briefingMail
    Sent by e-mail (09-email): the
    cards sent are left out of the
    next briefings for 48 hours
end note
note bottom of feedbackService
    The thumbs of the last 30 days: 15 titles liked
    and 15 refused as examples for the AI; a source
    found for the profile refused 3 times, and twice
    as often as liked, is left out
end note
package "Data" as Data {
    class briefingModel {
        + create()
        + step()
        + finish()
        + fail()
        + failAbandoned()
        + running()
        + latest()
        + ofUser()
        + vote()
        + votes()
        + sentSince()
        + watched()
        + analysis()
        + addItem()
        + removeItem()
        + articlePictures()
    }
    class storyModel {
        + rank()
        + storyArticles()
        + threadsOf()
        + versionsIn()
        + versionsAcross()
    }
    class profileModel {
        + get()
        + briefingInterests()
        + projects()
        + ownFeedUrls()
        + keptSources()
    }
    class feedModel {
        + userFeedUrls()
        + everyoneFeedUrls()
        + feedMedia()
        + trustedMedia()
        + trustedFeedUrls()
    }
}
note bottom of storyModel
    rank: rank_profile_stories in SQL, each news
    scores its best interest of the profile and of
    its projects running, weight × (dense + 0.5 sparse);
    versionsIn / versionsAcross: the closest stories
    in the reader's language (from 0.75) and in the
    others (from 0.78), by their centroids
end note
package "Ranking, choosing and checking" as Choosing {
    class googleNews {
        + credibleStory()
        + isRepeatedPage()
        + googleAvailable()
        + pickCandidates()
    }
    class repeats {
        + shownStories()
        + withoutRepeats()
        + evolvedStories()
    }
    class feedback {
        + examplesOf()
        + refusedCounts()
    }
    class profileAi {
        + shareOut()
        + selectStories()
        + balanceSelection()
        + checkStories()
        + mergeStories()
        + reviewCards()
    }
}
note bottom of googleNews
    Candidates: 40 stories of the feeds and 10 known
    only through Google News (2 per medium), more for
    20 or 30 cards; plus 10 of a trusted medium among
    the 60 closest. Left out: a story of Google News
    told by one medium we read no feed of, and a
    title one medium gives again for hours
end note
note bottom of repeats
    A story of a card sent by e-mail in the
    last 48 hours, or of its affair, is left
    out, unless the AI says its news since
    tell something new: then a follow-up
end note
note bottom of profileAi
    selectStories: up to 20 stories for 10 cards (30
    for 20, 45 for 30), the next ones a reserve; balanceSelection: each
    interest its share. checkStories and mergeStories
    sent together: the articles telling the news of the
    lead kept, two cards of one news joined, with the
    versions in other languages. reviewCards in 08b
end note
package "AI" as AiPackage {
    class ollama {
        + ollamaJson()
        + newUsage()
    }
}
note left of ollama
    6 calls at once for the whole server. A call
    unanswered after 120 s, or failing, goes to
    Gemini (the same model); a call naming its own
    model (deepseek-v4-pro) never does
end note
class "Ollama cloud\n(gemma4:31b, deepseek-v4-pro:0813)" as OllamaCloud <<external>>
class "Gemini API (gemma-4-31b-it)" as Gemini <<external>>
class "PostgreSQL + pgvector" as PostgreSQL <<external>>

EndUser --> briefingRouter
briefingRouter --> Guards
briefingRouter --> briefingController
briefingController --> briefingService
briefingController --> admin : isAdmin
briefingService --> feedbackService
briefingService --> discoveryService : prune the sources\nthat bring nothing
briefingService --> ingestService : the Google News\nsearches of the interests
briefingService --> entityService : what the\nprofile follows
briefingService ..> briefingMail
briefingService --> Choosing
briefingService --> Data
feedbackService --> feedback
feedbackService --> Data
googleNews -[hidden]down- feedback
jwt -[hidden]right- activeProfile
activeProfile -[hidden]right- admin
admin -[hidden]right- rateLimit
repeats -[hidden]down- profileAi
repeats --> ollama
profileAi --> ollama
ollama --> OllamaCloud
ollama --> Gemini
Data --> PostgreSQL
@enduml
